# Proof: F-V3-CRC
# Top: v3_crc
# Assumptions: none; every input is arbitrary on every cycle.
# Properties: reset matches a fresh model.Crc; configuration changes only on
#   configure; configure alone leaves the register alone; load takes the seed;
#   shift is one step of the recurrence (shift, then XOR the polynomial when
#   the outgoing bit XOR the message bit is set), for both directions.
# Method: temporal induction.
# Scope and abstractions: formal/README.md.

read_verilog -formal src/v3_crc.v
prep -top v3_crc
flatten
opt
async2sync
dffunmap
sat -seq 4 -tempinduct -maxsteps 16 -set-assumes -prove-asserts -verify
